{"id":"wb-5-263","name":"泽州岱庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"泽州岱庙","text":"泽州岱庙位于中国山西省晋城市泽州县南村镇冶底村，始建于北宋元丰三年，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n泽州岱庙坐北朝南，占地3720平方米，现存天齐殿、东西配殿、东西垛殿等建筑，其中天齐殿为宋代原构，余为明清建筑。天齐殿面阔三间，进深三间，单檐歇山顶。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%BD%E5%B7%9E%E5%B2%B1%E5%BA%99","revisionId":92924763,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92924763","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f140da0cf3b53a7c8777b401.jpg","title":"20260530_Zezhou_Dai_Temple_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260530_Zezhou_Dai_Temple_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9d/20260530_Zezhou_Dai_Temple_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​晋城 泽州冶底岱庙","width":320,"height":213}}